{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if the meteor shower that destroyed Earth\u2026 wasn\u2019t natural at all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generations ago, humanity fled to the orbital colony <strong>ARD</strong>, leaving Earth behind after a \u201cmeteor storm\u201d scorched the surface. But now, a mysterious <strong>distress signal</strong> calls you back and you discover the truth: the meteors were the <strong>first alien strike</strong>, and a resistance still fights on Earth\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Gravity</strong>, a skilled pilot caught between duty, family, and survival. Guided first by your sister <strong>Aurora</strong>, and later joined by resistance fighter <strong>Ryan</strong>, you must uncover fragments of the past, face overwhelming alien forces, and make the ultimate choice: defend Earth in a last stand, or save ARD in orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/5209c0f6ab2ee38002886adfe0931985.avif?t=1763120042\" width=790 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/2f21548181b2979220b1b9ee6e46ece2.webp?t=1763120042\" width=603 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/35268e03abb104ca21652f3709471246.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/35268e03abb104ca21652f3709471246.webm?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/35268e03abb104ca21652f3709471246.mp4?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bullet hell SHMUP with a branching narrative full of betrayal, sacrifice, and two possible endings<strong>.</strong>\u00a0Earth is no longer safe. Humanity\u2019s last fleet has ventured <strong>Beyond Solar</strong>, facing an onslaught of mechanical armadas and alien warlords determined to erase us from existence. Step into the cockpit of an advanced strike fighter and battle across hostile galaxies in a relentless bullet hell campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/dcfee4b7d997928bb52bbff55d299d51.avif?t=1763120042\" width=944 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/8dfc9f3838f8b25ba0273b152e6b3b1b.webp?t=1763120042\" width=655 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/950b25cb94aa594c29c8f2a21f3c88d0.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/950b25cb94aa594c29c8f2a21f3c88d0.webm?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/950b25cb94aa594c29c8f2a21f3c88d0.mp4?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal System</strong><br>Upgrade and customize your ship with the <strong>Arsenal System</strong>, unlocking new weapons, defenses, and abilities to match your combat style. Whether you prefer overwhelming firepower, agile maneuvering, or tactical balance, every choice shapes how you dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone Crafting System</strong><br>Deploy powerful <strong>support drones</strong> to assist you in combat. From offensive units that unleash devastating attacks to specialized drones that enhance your battlefield control, each crafted drone adds a new layer of strategy and adaptability to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/1a018da1582fa03cc2035b8c1ae4933e.avif?t=1763120042\" width=725 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/1ee47021807eb30799957c1c57d9d79a.webp?t=1763120042\" width=816 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/8f96b73512930c3c9e2fb88932a74972.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/8f96b73512930c3c9e2fb88932a74972.webm?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/8f96b73512930c3c9e2fb88932a74972.mp4?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players from around the world in intense <strong>Ranked 1v1 battles</strong>. Climb the competitive <strong>leaderboard</strong> by proving your skill, earning victories, and securing your place among the top pilots. Compete across <strong>Seasonal Ranks</strong>, where each season resets the battlefield and offers new rewards for those bold enough to fight for the top. Every duel pushes you closer to mastery. Will you rise to the top or fall in the ranks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/574c7e704bdbe61072f49a7a3545770b.avif?t=1763120042\" width=622 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span cla