ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/516d0e388e6894b9a336dc9027a24bfd.avif?t=1763120042\" width=852 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/92ca54c4d88ea203c62117cfcfa53cc1.webp?t=1763120042\" width=386 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.webm?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.mp4?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Galactic Rankings</strong> showcase the best of the best, where every victory in <strong>Ranked 1v1 battles</strong> pushes you higher among the galaxy\u2019s elite. Progress through the <strong>Ranking Divisions</strong>. From <strong>Recruit</strong> to <strong>Combat</strong>, <strong>Tactical</strong>, <strong>Elite</strong>, and finally the coveted <strong>Legendary Division</strong>. Rise through the competitive ladder, prove your skill against rival pilots, and secure your spot at the top. Only the most determined will leave their mark on the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for humanity isn\u2019t just about survival it\u2019s about who we choose to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gear up, pilot. <strong>Beyond Solar</strong> begins where Earth awakens.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1281560?t=1763120042","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763120042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/e545dd0e5672516275497a5f899218f4ecdc5cac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763120042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/e545dd0e5672516275497a5f899218f4ecdc5cac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763120042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if the meteor shower that destroyed Earth\u2026 wasn\u2019t natural at all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generations ago, humanity fled to the orbital colony <strong>ARD</strong>, leaving Earth behind after a \u201cmeteor storm\u201d scorched the surface. But now, a mysterious <strong>distress signal</strong> calls you back and you discover the truth: the meteors were the <strong>first alien strike</strong>, and a resistance still fights on Earth\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Gravity</strong>, a skilled pilot caught between duty, family, and survival. Guided first by your sister <strong>Aurora</strong>, and later joined by resistance fighter <strong>Ryan</strong>, you must uncover fragments of the past, face overwhelming alien forces, and make the ultimate choice: defend Earth in a last stand, or save ARD in orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/5209c0f6ab2ee38002886adfe0931985.avif?t=1763120042\" width=790 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/2f21548181b2979220b1b9ee6e46ece2.webp?t=1763120042\" width=603 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/35268e03abb104ca21652f3709471246.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"ht