style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/92ca54c4d88ea203c62117cfcfa53cc1.webp?t=1763120042\" width=386 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.poster.avif?t=1763120042\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.webm?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/extras/00e0b0b12de1f62ae6283044ecf49eb4.mp4?t=1763120042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Galactic Rankings</strong> showcase the best of the best, where every victory in <strong>Ranked 1v1 battles</strong> pushes you higher among the galaxy\u2019s elite. Progress through the <strong>Ranking Divisions</strong>. From <strong>Recruit</strong> to <strong>Combat</strong>, <strong>Tactical</strong>, <strong>Elite</strong>, and finally the coveted <strong>Legendary Division</strong>. Rise through the competitive ladder, prove your skill against rival pilots, and secure your spot at the top. Only the most determined will leave their mark on the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for humanity isn\u2019t just about survival it\u2019s about who we choose to become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gear up, pilot. <strong>Beyond Solar</strong> begins where Earth awakens.</p>","developers":["COREGAME Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281560/bd84d47eb36af53f83f5bcb552d1e87674e75069/header.jpg?t=1763120042","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281560/597558281/3d72fad6e9be687946a8b45cc88e68eef34d07be/1763117954/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763120041","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281560/597558281/3d72fad6e9be687946a8b45cc88e68eef34d07be/1763117954/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763120041","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1281560/597558281/3d72fad6e9be687946a8b45cc88e68eef34d07be/1763117954/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763120041","id":257231526,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257231526/movie480.mp4?t=1763120041","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257231526/movie_max.mp4?t=1763120041"},"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257231526/e17a07768d84f63de92d9809d10df1a47d127f2f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763120041","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257231526/movie480.webm?t=1763120041","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store